/3AKAB2 b - - 12 25"}],"annotations":[{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment18:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment18","raw_text":"    以上是较为流行的中炮七兵对三步虎后补列炮的变化。现红弃送三兵佳着，可趁机活通子力，黑退车明智，如误走车8平7，则车四进一，以下有相三进一和炮八进一手段，黑车将陷入困境。","text":"    以上是较为流行的中炮七兵对三步虎后补列炮的变化。现红弃送三兵佳着，可趁机活通子力，黑退车明智，如误走车8平7，则车四进一，以下有相三进一和炮八进一手段，黑车将陷入困境。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":18,"anchor_node_id":"0:18","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment29:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment29","raw_text":"    黑左车退至2线，欲囚禁红车，实则贪小利而失大局，应改走车8平7尚可应付。||    如图形势，红方扑出左马强兑，准备一车搏双扩展优势，已是胸有成竹，着法亦十分精警有力。","text":"    黑左车退至2线，欲囚禁红车，实则贪小利而失大局，应改走车8平7尚可应付。\n    如图形势，红方扑出左马强兑，准备一车搏双扩展优势，已是胸有成竹，着法亦十分精警有力。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":29,"anchor_node_id":"0:29","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment35:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment35","raw_text":"    红方一车换双以后，双马异常活跃，优势明显。现回马踏中卒拓展攻势，着法简洁干脆。","text":"    红方一车换双以后，双马异常活跃，优势明显。现回马踏中卒拓展攻势，着法简洁干脆。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":35,"anchor_node_id":"0:35","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment40:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment40","raw_text":"    黑退车卒林防红跃马叫杀，亦是无奈。如车8平7跟炮，则车八进二，下伏多种杀势，黑亦难应。","text":"    黑退车卒林防红跃马叫杀，亦是无奈。如车8平7跟炮，则车八进二，下伏多种杀势，黑亦难应。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":40,"anchor_node_id":"0:40","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment42:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment42","raw_text":"    黑只好出将，否则车八平五。","text":"    黑只好出将，否则车八平五。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":42,"anchor_node_id":"0:42","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment43:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment43","raw_text":"    红趁势跃马攻王，暗藏多路杀法，大局已定。","text":"    红趁势跃马攻王，暗藏多路杀法，大局已定。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":43,"anchor_node_id":"0:43","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment48:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment48","raw_text":"    黑如车1平3，则士六进五，将5平4，炮五平六，将4平5，车四进二，红胜。","text":"    黑如车1平3，则士六进五，将5平4，炮五平六，将4平5，车四进二，红胜。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":48,"anchor_node_id":"0:48","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment49:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment49","raw_text":"    以下必成闷杀，黑遂认负。||","text":"    以下必成闷杀，黑遂认负。\n","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":49,"anchor_node_id":"0:49","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["087厦门蔡忠诚 先胜 浙江陈孝堃"],"DhtmlXQ_event":["第二章 顺手炮、列手炮(32局)"],"DhtmlXQ_open":["D40 中炮对左三步虎转列炮"],"DhtmlXQ_remark":[""],"DhtmlXQ_author":[""],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"]},"source_tag_count":16,"identical_tag_duplicates":0,"binit":"0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383","side_to_move":"w","side_basis":"color of first source mover at binit square","standard_start":true,"summary":{"lines":1,"structured_branches":0,"line_statuses":{"legal":1},"source_move_records":49,"legal_move_records":49,"annotations":8,"annotation_statuses":{"attached":8}},"memberships":[{"book_id":"yl-book-66","category_id":"66","title":"第二章 顺手炮、列手炮 厦门蔡忠诚 先胜 浙江陈孝堃","catalogue_order":86,"directory_url":"https://m.xiangqiqipu.com/Category/List-66-4.html"}],"book_ids":["yl-book-66"]}}
